WEBVTT

00:03:29.704 --> 00:03:32.163
I decided to find Abed,

00:03:32.163 --> 00:03:33.621
and when I finally did,

00:03:33.621 --> 00:03:37.079
he responded to my Hebrew "Hello"
which such nonchalance,

00:03:37.121 --> 00:03:39.288
it seemed he'd been awaiting
my phone call.

00:03:39.746 --> 00:03:41.121
And maybe he had.

00:03:42.079 --> 00:03:44.913
I didn't mention to Abed
his prior driving record --

00:03:44.913 --> 00:03:48.954
27 violations by the age of 25,

00:03:48.954 --> 00:03:53.329
the last, his not shifting his truck
into a low gear on that May day --

00:03:53.371 --> 00:03:55.413
and I didn't mention my prior record --

00:03:55.454 --> 00:03:57.163
the quadriplegia and the catheters,

00:03:57.204 --> 00:03:59.413
the insecurity and the loss --

00:03:59.454 --> 00:04:02.621
and when Abed went on
about how hurt he was in the crash,